Party welcome for the top datalab user: custom welcome card, rotating
combos of synthesised tunes and Freesound samples, and bouncing party parrots.

Only fires for user IDs listed in VUE_APP_PARTY_USER_IDS (comma-separated,
webapp build-time env); optional VUE_APP_PARTY_WELCOME_MESSAGE.
Force a replay with ?party or ?party=N (1-based combo index).
Sample credits/licences: webapp/public/party-sounds/CREDITS.md

Generated against v0.8.0-alpha.2-16-g306d3504 (306d3504).
Apply from the datalab repo root with: git apply <this file>

